comunidad global de blockchain. ¡Postula ahora! 🚀💡","audience":"free","comments_enabled":true,"comments_state":"default","enforce_gated_content":true,"enable_popup_on_scroll":false,"email_capture_title":"Suscríbete para seguir leyendo","email_capture_message":"Este contenido es gratuito, pero debes estar suscrito a Tellus Cooperative para continuar leyendo.","email_capture_cta":"Suscríbete","estimated_reading_time":4,"estimated_reading_time_display":"4 minutos","paywall_id":null,"authors":[{"id":"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12","name":"Pau Koh","profile_picture":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/pau_headshot_1.png","thumb":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/thumb_pau_headshot_1.png"},"landscape":{"url":"https://beehiiv-images-production.s3.amazonaws.com/uploads/user/profile_picture/f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12/landscape_pau_headshot_1.png"}},"bio":"𝘊𝘔𝘎𝘙/𝘛𝘦𝘭𝘭𝘶𝘴 𝘊𝘰𝘰𝘱𝘦𝘳𝘢𝘵𝘪𝘷𝘦","twitter_handle":"kl0ren","facebook_url":null,"instagram_url":null,"linkedin_url":null,"tiktok_url":null,"youtube_url":null,"discord_url":null,"bluesky_url":null}],"content_tags":[{"id":"4736ce87-6b98-48fc-aa4c-b23c818e1a23","display":"Stellar en Español","slug":"stellar-en-espanol"}],"created_at":"2025-04-08T22:16:40Z","updated_at":"2025-04-08T22:42:50Z","html":null,"hide_premium_post":false,"contains_subscriber_break":false,"is_accessible_for_free":true,"paywall_shown":false,"metered_usage_shown":false,"metered_viewed_count":null,"force_premium":false,"enforce_paywall_breaks":true,"display_thumbnail_on_web":true,"display_title_on_web":true,"display_subtitle_on_web":true,"author_urls":{"f296a348-b27c-4e82-ae84-fce2e49bff12":"https://blog.telluscoop.com/authors/pau-koh"},"custom_structured_data":null},"body":"<div class=\"_10pdwo80 dream-post-content-doc\"><div id=\"qu-es-el-stellar-community-fund-scf\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Qué es el Stellar Community Fund (SCF)?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar Community Fund</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> es una iniciativa de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar Development Foundation (SDF)</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> que apoya a equipos y proyectos dentro del ecosistema Stellar. A través de programas de financiamiento como el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Kickstart Award</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Build Award</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, el SCF brinda el apoyo necesario para que las ideas innovadoras se conviertan en realidades con impacto global.</span><br></p></div><div class=\"py-2\"><div class=\"twitter-wrapper mx-auto max-w-[520px]\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet text-center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/TellusCoop/status/1909737483467633111\"><p>— #<!-- --> (#<!-- -->)<br></p></a></blockquote></div></div><div id=\"tipos-de-programas-kickstart-y-buil\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Tipos de Programas: Kickstart y Build Awards</span></h3></div><div id=\"scf-build-award\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h4 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx5\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>SCF Build Award</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">💥</span></h4></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>SCF Build Award</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> está diseñado para proyectos que ya cuentan con una </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>validación de mercado</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y un </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>MVP (Minimum Viable Product)</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">. Si tu proyecto tiene tracción real y está listo para expandirse, este programa es para ti.</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Premio</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Hasta </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>$150.000 </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>XLM</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> para lanzar y hacer crecer tu proyecto en Stellar o Soroban.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Apoyo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Incluye financiamiento, soporte técnico y acceso a la comunidad de Stellar.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Perfil de Proyectos</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Buscamos </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>proyectos validados</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">, aplicaciones DeFi, herramientas para la infraestructura Web3, y soluciones que impacten mercados globales.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div id=\"scf-kickstart-award\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h4 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx5\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>SCF Kickstart Award</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> </span><span class=\"dl6s8g0 hxnnnr0\">🌱</span></h4></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si tu proyecto aún está en las primeras etapas de desarrollo, el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Kickstart Award</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> es una excelente opción para comenzar. Este programa está dirigido a equipos con ideas prometedoras pero que necesitan mentoría y apoyo para encontrar el ajuste de producto y mercado.</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Premio</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Hasta </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>$15.000 </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>XLM</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Apoyo</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: Bootcamp de 5 días, asesoramiento por mentores expertos, y la posibilidad de pasar al </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Build Award</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> si tu proyecto gana tracción.</span></p></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-imageBlock _2fealp0\" style=\"--caption-alignment:center\"><div class=\"_2fealp1\"><picture><source media=\"(max-width: 360px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=720,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/82a9739c-1c12-4b6c-9ca8-3e64611d526d/image.png?t=1744151109 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 360px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=360,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/82a9739c-1c12-4b6c-9ca8-3e64611d526d/image.png?t=1744151109 1x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px) and (min-resolution: 2dppx)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=860,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/82a9739c-1c12-4b6c-9ca8-3e64611d526d/image.png?t=1744151109 2x\"><source media=\"(max-width: 430px)\" srcset=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,width=430,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/82a9739c-1c12-4b6c-9ca8-3e64611d526d/image.png?t=1744151109 1x\"><img src=\"https://media.beehiiv.com/cdn-cgi/image/fit=scale-down,quality=80,format=auto,onerror=redirect/uploads/asset/file/82a9739c-1c12-4b6c-9ca8-3e64611d526d/image.png?t=1744151109\" alt=\"\" width=\"1292\" height=\"864\" style=\"width:100%;border-radius:0px;aspect-ratio:1292 / 864;height:auto\" class=\"_2fealp2 _2fealp5\"></picture></div></div><div id=\"fechas-importantes\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Fechas Importantes</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si estás interesado en participar, asegúrate de tener en cuenta las fechas clave para la </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>SCF #36</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Fecha límite para enviar el abstract</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">: </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>4 de mayo de 2025</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El proceso completo dura aproximadamente </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>5 semanas</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> e incluye:</span></p></div><div class=\"dream-post-content-bulletList _1ao94nj0\"><ul translations=\"[object Object]\" class=\"_1ao94nj1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Envío de la postulación.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Revisión de expertos y la comunidad.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Votación comunitaria.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Recibir financiamiento y soporte si eres seleccionado.</span></p></div></li></ul></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"py-2\"><div class=\"twitter-wrapper mx-auto max-w-[520px]\"><blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet text-center\"><a href=\"https://twitter.com/TellusCoop/status/1909737496466149778\"><p>— #<!-- --> (#<!-- -->)<br></p></a></blockquote></div></div><div id=\"cmo-postular\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Cómo Postular?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El proceso para postular es sencillo. Solo sigue estos pasos:</span></p></div><div class=\"vl18bi0\"><ol class=\"vl18bi1\" translations=\"[object Object]\" start=\"1\"><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Entra al sitio web del SCF</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y crea tu proyecto.</span><br><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">👉 </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/?utm_source=referral&amp;utm_campaign=scf_referral_SAPCL\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"\" class=\"_3k8pkd0\">Accede a SCF para postularte</a></span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Completa tu </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>abstract</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> antes del </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>4 de mayo de 2025</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si tu proyecto es seleccionado, serás invitado a continuar con el proceso y participar en el </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Build Award</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">.</span></p></div></li><li class=\"_11av8sw0\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Recibe financiamiento por etapas y continúa creciendo dentro del ecosistema Stellar.</span></p></div></li></ol></div><div data-generic-embed-container=\"true\" class=\"_8dv9ja0\"><a href=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/?utm_source=referral&amp;utm_campaign=scf_referral_SAPCL\" target=\"_blank\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja2\" style=\"--generic-embed-image-width:40%\"><div data-generic-embed-layout=\"true\" class=\"border-collapse w-full flex sm:flex-row flex-col-reverse\"><div class=\"_8dv9ja1\"><div data-generic-embed-title=\"true\" class=\"rq7pc90\"><p class=\"rq7pc91\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Stellar Community Fund</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-description=\"true\" class=\"_1uh4x2v0\"><p class=\"_1uh4x2v2\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El Stellar Community Fund es un programa de postulación abierta que se basa en la participación de la comunidad para distribuir premios y apoyar proyectos construidos sobre Stellar y Soroban.</span></p></div><div data-generic-embed-host=\"true\" class=\"efatai0\"><p class=\"efatai1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">communityfund.stellar.org/?utm_source=referral&amp;utm_campaign=scf_referral_SAPCL</span></p></div></div><div data-generic-embed-image-wrapper=\"true\" data-generic-embed-image-right=\"true\" class=\"w-full mb-[20px] sm:mb-0 sm:ml-[20px] sm:w-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] sm:basis-[var(--generic-embed-image-width)] flex\" style=\"align-self:center\"><img src=\"https://communityfund.stellar.org/img/new-scf-card.png\" class=\"w-full h-auto object-cover\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></a></div><div id=\"por-qu-postular-al-scf\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Por qué Postular al SCF?</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">El </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Stellar Community Fund</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> ya ha entregado más de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>$40 millones </strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>XLM</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> a </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>más de 600 proyectos</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> alrededor del mundo. Los equipos que han participado en el SCF han podido validar sus ideas, lanzar sus productos y escalar sus proyectos con el apoyo de </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>mentores expertos</strong></span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"> y la infraestructura global de Stellar.</span></p></div><div id=\"eres-de-latam-o-chile\" class=\"hynlcx0\"><h3 class=\"hynlcx1 hynlcx4\" translations=\"[object Object]\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">¿Eres de LATAM o Chile? 🌎</span></h3></div><div class=\"j6zgbu0\"><p class=\"dream-post-content-paragraph j6zgbu1\"><span class=\"hxnnnr0\">Si estás en </span><span class=\"hxnnnr0\"><strong>Latinoamérica</strong></span><span class=\"hxn